<title>USA: PAB Bankshares Inc increases quarterly div.</title>
<headline>PAB Bankshares Inc increases quarterly div.</headline>
<dateline>VALDOSTA, Ga. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PAB Bankshares Inc said on Wednesday it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.085 per share from $0.080 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable July 15 to shareholders of record on July 1.</p>
<p>PAB is the parent company of the Park Avenue Bank, the Farmers &amp; Merchants Bank and the First Community Bank of Southwest Georgia.</p>
